# === ADR-0021: Content Configuration Layer runtime data ===
# Editable display copy + uploaded artwork are OPERATOR data, not project
# source. Keeping them out of git is what lets configured content survive a
# branch switch, and stops the repository growing with every image swap.
data/content/

